# SE-002: Separate a dissolved nonpolar solute from a soluble salt
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 NaCl 0.001mol
add v1 naphthalene 0.000005mol
new
filter v1 v2
new
extract v2 v3 hexane 20mL
measure v2 conductivity
measure v3 chromatograph
inspect
